    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350500/extras/a36c3755609075884c3920b40ee9bf14.avif?t=1734267786\" width=658 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhile Helio was delivering a letter, he finds himself embroiled in a case of disappearance that will take him much further than expected...\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RPG Maker game with lots of illustrations and guest artists! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. 6 hours of gameplay, including main and side quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unique playable characters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several endings and hidden secrets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several animations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voices for every playable character.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 in-game collectible cards.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A varied bestiary </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350500/extras/a36c3755609075884c3920b40ee9bf14.avif?t=1734267786\" width=658 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhile Helio was delivering a letter, he finds himself embroiled in a case of disappearance that will take him much further than expected...\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RPG Maker game with lots of illustrations and guest artists! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. 6 hours of gameplay, including main and side quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unique playable characters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several endings and hidden secrets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several animations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voices for every playable character.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 in-game collectible cards.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A varied bestiary </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In a world where magic is a rare privilege, a mailman with mysterious powers finds himself at the heart of a conflict between magical families.",
